  "totalBlocks": 82,
  "translatedBlocks": 82,
  "blocks": [
    {
      "id": "b0001",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "50e5849b26f4d666",
      "translationZh": "今天，我们分享一项研究，将 AI 智能体设计中的两种强大范式结合起来：基于代码的行动所具备的表达能力，以及结构化生成的可靠性。我们的研究结果表明，强制 CodeAgents 以结构化 JSON 格式生成思考内容和代码，可以在多个基准测试中显著优于传统方法。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0002",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "62d4928be6452080",
      "translationZh": "图 1：三种方法在 SmolBench（GAIA、MATH、SimpleQA 和 Frames）上的准确率比较：Structured CodeAgent（蓝色）、CodeAgent（橙色）和 ToolCallingAgent（灰色）。误差条表示 95% 置信区间。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0003",
      "kind": "heading",
      "sourceHash": "457ad711812b2d3b",
      "translationZh": "🤔 智能体行动的演变",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0004",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "e6346361a0837da7",
      "translationZh": "AI 智能体需要在现实世界中采取行动——无论是调用 API、处理数据，还是通过推理解决复杂问题。智能体表达这些行动的方式已经历了几种范式的演变：",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0005",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "93aaa5eef54474fc",
      "translationZh": "传统 JSON 智能体：智能体生成结构化 JSON 来调用工具。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0006",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "ea54b1a68eba1bf1",
      "translationZh": "这些智能体通过从预定义工具列表中选择工具并生成 JSON 格式的调用来运作。这种工具调用方法因 OpenAI 的函数调用 API 而得到普及，此后一直是使用最广泛的工具调用方法。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0007",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "87b3b34f708ae8c2",
      "translationZh": "这种方法可靠，但受限于：",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0008",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "4cd09877df380cf4",
      "translationZh": "有限的行动集合：智能体可以采取的行动只能通过预定义工具来表达，这限制了其功能。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0009",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "7549d0b665441699",
      "translationZh": "缺乏可组合性：如果任务需要整合多个来源的信息，JSON 智能体就会难以应对，因为它们不支持在多次工具调用之间维护中间状态。虽然有些模型支持并行工具调用，但它们无法轻松处理一个工具的输出决定下一步操作，或需要将多个结果放在一起比较和处理的场景。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0010",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "ec6704ef3e0f78a6",
      "translationZh": "结构僵化：在工具与实际需要完成的工作不完全匹配的情况下，处理能力非常有限。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0011",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "6e23b51fe5522c7d",
      "translationZh": "代码智能体：智能体利用自身固有的编程能力，直接编写可执行的 Python 代码。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0012",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "3bfd8548f2e9d9c2",
      "translationZh": "这一转变最初在论文《Executable Code Actions Elicit Better LLM Agents》中以 CodeAct 的形式提出，使 AI 智能体除了调用工具之外，还能灵活地编写任意可执行的 Python 代码。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0013",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "b575cabacc7130e2",
      "translationZh": "这里的关键洞见是，工具直接从代码内部调用，使变量和状态管理可靠得多。智能体可以在循环、函数和条件语句中调用工具——本质上是在每次行动中生成一个动态的工具执行图！",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0014",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "fe89a3ea017a5cd8",
      "translationZh": "使用 CodeAgent 的优点：",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0015",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "8da016eb9152e03c",
      "translationZh": "智能工具使用：智能体根据当下的情况决定使用哪些工具。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0016",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "ba06bfa7452c0444",
      "translationZh": "无限灵活性：可以使用任何 Python 功能来实现目标。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0017",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "aaa2714886250d3e",
      "translationZh": "检验想法的能力：智能体可以提出假设并进行检验，从而在行动上更灵活",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0018",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "8c2d4ba44ae5de7b",
      "translationZh": "不过，从 markdown 中解析代码可能容易出错，这让我们提出一个建议：为什么不使用结构化生成来生成代码动作呢？",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0019",
      "kind": "heading",
      "sourceHash": "c72f8c1f94e55ee8",
      "translationZh": "➡️ 为代码智能体添加结构化输出",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0020",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "362ca854d6c012a5",
      "translationZh": "借助结构化输出，你可以强制 LLM 以 JSON 数据块的形式生成明确的想法和代码：",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0021",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "e7be2001cf8e5bcd",
      "translationZh": "关键区别在于，生成过程受到强制约束：也就是说，现在不再只是通过提示要求模型先输出想法、再输出代码，而是使用结构化输出强制它遵循指定的结构。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0022",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "5afc778838c8cc3e",
      "translationZh": "这种方法将结构化生成的可靠性与代码执行的灵活性结合起来，从而兼得两者的优势。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0023",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "2dae7e6a8c13e622",
      "translationZh": "显式推理：thoughts 字段强制智能体在采取行动前进行推理。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0024",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "4404f40102613813",
      "translationZh": "可靠的解析：JSON 结构消除了 markdown 解析错误",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0025",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "408b7fe2934c7b39",
      "translationZh": "完整的代码表达能力：code 字段保留了代码智能体的全部灵活性",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0026",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "0ee2ca9fe4025cbd",
      "translationZh": "更好的分离：规划与执行之间界限清晰",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0027",
      "kind": "heading",
      "sourceHash": "9145066009a0d011",
      "translationZh": "🧪 基准测试结果",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0028",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "7726449c03a5233b",
      "translationZh": "我们在包括 GAIA、MATH、SimpleQA 和 Frames 在内的多个基准测试中比较了这三种范式。结果呈现出一个清晰的规律：代码动作 + 结构化生成能够持续提升能力较强模型的表现。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0029",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "3939b80474ce5b66",
      "translationZh": "对于大多数能力较强的模型，结构化方法的表现始终优于常规 CodeAgent 方法，平均高出 2-7 个百分点。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0030",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "a8c0b389329418c1",
      "translationZh": "OpenAI 模型：采用结构化方式后提升最大，尤其是在高度依赖推理的任务上",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0031",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "f551b748f22df9fd",
      "translationZh": "Claude 模型：受益于结构化方式，其中 Claude 3.7 Sonnet 的表现尤为出色",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0032",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "b461b23dd56a6242",
      "translationZh": "Qwen 模型：采用结构化方式后通常有所提升，不过对于较小的模型，“结构税”（见下一节）开始显现。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0033",
      "kind": "heading",
      "sourceHash": "e301bc1e54dc54be",
      "translationZh": "💡 为什么结构（通常）有帮助",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0034",
      "kind": "heading",
      "sourceHash": "ecdaa55bf8c74c93",
      "translationZh": "解析问题确实存在",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0035",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "1ff5a38cc3b77748",
      "translationZh": "我们在 smolagents 中实现的 CodeAgent 会从 LLM 输出中提取 Python 代码，在以下情况下可能失败：",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0036",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "60eb5bc822cec83d",
      "translationZh": "markdown 中的代码块写法不完整或格式不正确",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0037",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "5452e68d9cc87623",
      "translationZh": "单次响应中出现多个代码块",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0038",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "c8ee86d57bf328ca",
      "translationZh": "结构化生成通过可靠的 JSON 解析消除了这些问题。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0039",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "44fb4cfa73247f79",
      "translationZh": "为了理解结构化生成为何重要，我们分析了各项基准测试中的 15,724 条智能体执行轨迹。结果令人瞩目：",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0040",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "1b99d310bb5cf40f",
      "translationZh": "2.4% 的执行轨迹在首次调用时出现了解析错误",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0041",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "b71c0092973b0caf",
      "translationZh": "首次调用出现解析错误的执行轨迹：成功率为 42.3%",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0042",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "5c42695ea25b9b8c",
      "translationZh": "首次调用未出现解析错误的执行轨迹：成功率为 51.3%",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0043",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "9de7ba96a3eb5750",
      "translationZh": "没有解析错误的智能体执行轨迹，其成功率比存在解析错误的执行轨迹高 21.3%。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0044",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "4b534fce14de6558",
      "translationZh": "这不仅仅关乎便利性——解析错误会引发一连串失败，显著影响智能体的整体表现。当智能体因代码格式错误而无法执行第一个动作时，它往往难以恢复，进而走上并非最优的问题求解路径。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0045",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "cfc0477bc9e3f104",
      "translationZh": "图 2：第一步中的解析错误使智能体的成功率降低 21.3%，并使执行步骤的平均数量从 3.18 增加到 4.63。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0046",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "74061ea88743bf7f",
      "translationZh": "此外：强制推理过程",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0047",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "f4b709d97d3ee7b9",
      "translationZh": "使用结构化生成和显式思考，不仅会提示智能体，还会强制它们在行动前阐明自己的推理过程。这会带来：",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0048",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "f58401dbf0fad523",
      "translationZh": "更好的规划：智能体会更系统地思考问题",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0049",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "4ddedac8e7588282",
      "translationZh": "可靠性增强：显式推理能及早发现逻辑错误",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0050",
      "kind": "heading",
      "sourceHash": "bb883799d9ef3ec1",
      "translationZh": "结构化的代价",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0051",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "c1f273d09f9b1921",
      "translationZh": "我们的结果还揭示了一个明确的能力门槛：模型需要具备足够的指令遵循能力，且其预训练数据中需要有足够的 JSON 覆盖，才能从结构化生成中受益。这表明，结构化方法最适合以下模型：",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0052",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "01970892fd19c11a",
      "translationZh": "经过充分训练的大型模型",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0053",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "90b329a840186122",
      "translationZh": "具有较强指令遵循能力的模型",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0054",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "381f185e032b5e79",
      "translationZh": "针对结构化生成进行过微调的模型。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0055",
      "kind": "heading",
      "sourceHash": "c7a45ca0073bf066",
      "translationZh": "当结构化失效时：一个真实示例",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0056",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "072b7c59ee5dc591",
      "translationZh": "当较小的模型（例如 mistralai/Mistral-7B-Instruct-v0.3）尝试生成结构化代码时，就会出现这样的情况——认知负荷变得过重：",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0057",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "527894011df87dcd",
      "translationZh": "模型生成了语法错误的 Python 代码：web_search(query=\"Eiffel Tower height\")\", ——注意这个格式错误的字符串，其中多了一个引号和一个逗号。这会立即引发 SyntaxError，导致执行失败。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0058",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "9d71e1453ffe5f7d",
      "translationZh": "这说明了“结构税”：较小的模型难以同时处理 JSON 格式、Python 语法和实际的问题求解逻辑。结构化生成带来的认知开销可能会超出这些模型的承受能力，而它们采用更简单的基于 markdown 的代码生成方式时，本来可以表现得相当不错。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0059",
      "kind": "heading",
      "sourceHash": "5d6bb74873d5cded",
      "translationZh": "🚀 何时使用 Structured CodeAgents",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0060",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "b235ed4f75d54d41",
      "translationZh": "✅ 在以下情况下使用 Structured CodeAgents：",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0061",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "72dadfac07132a0f",
      "translationZh": "使用能力较强的模型（32B+ 参数或前沿模型）",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
